<title>FRANCE: Sodexho sees yr net income at 535 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Sodexho sees yr net income at 535 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sodexho said on Thursday that it expected net income, less minority interests, to reach 535 million francs for the full 1996/97 financial year.</p>
<p>It made the forecast in a results statement that showed net income of 269.39 million francs for the first six months to February 28.</p>
<p>It said it expected year turnover to reach 28 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
